From e92f3c050ffbcb14a4b44b90e38914b7b80fccd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christoph Schmidt-Hieber <christoph.schmidthieber@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:49:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [b4c][msvc] enable Visual Studio 2022 builds

Rebase the downstream MSVC fixes onto upstream master fb331df5.
Keep the Windows runtime adaptations, reader coverage and structure packing.
Enable C23 typeof in C sources and use decltype for the C++ casts.
---
